From: Lume Retro OS
Subject: [PATCH] glslang: include <cstdint> in SpvBuilder.h

GCC 15 no longer pulls <cstdint> in transitively, and SpvBuilder.h uses
uint32_t and friends.

--- a/ext/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
+++ b/ext/glslang/SPIRV/SpvBuilder.h
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@
 }

 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <set>
